# Zig's own build-time state, if `zig build` is ever run directly against the
# vendored tree at third_party/ghostty/ instead of through `cargo build` (which
# always builds from a copy under target/, never here). TASK-1.34, third_party/README.md:
# a second guard, not the fix - the fix is setting ZIG_LOCAL_PKG_DIR and --cache-dir
# away from this tree whenever that's done.
third_party/ghostty/zig-pkg/
third_party/ghostty/.zig-cache/
